%% draw-visual:
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P0 as Terminal
  participant P1 as CLI
  participant P2 as agent-plane
  participant P3 as PostgreSQL
  participant P4 as vmagent
  participant P5 as Command
  P0->>P1: write file
  P1->>P2: write W1
  P2->>P3: save W1
  P2->>P4: write W1, bounded
  Note over P4: stage, publish, journal
  P4->>P2: W1 done
  P2->>P3: W1 done
  P2->>P1: W1 done
  P0->>P1: exec on a
  P1->>P2: command X1
  P2->>P3: reserve slot
  P2->>P4: dispatch X1
  P4->>P5: launch
  Note over P5: use file, write results
  Note over P0,P5: X1 still runs, file actions stay available
  P0->>P1: read file
  P1->>P2: bounded read
  P2->>P4: read within limit
  P4->>P2: bounded bytes
  P2->>P1: bytes
  P1->>P0: print bytes
